rule refund_desk v1
description "Which desk of a store refunds a sale: the service desk for what was opened; for the rest, the kids' counter for what the children's section sold, and the floor for the others. Three sections are named with an apostrophe, which a gate cannot write in a name, and each has an alias, which a gate writes. A sketch written for the tests"

enum section = Home | Men's(mens) | Women's(womens) | Children's(childrens)
enum desk_kind = floor | kids_counter | service_desk

inputs
  sold_in : section
  opened  : bool

outputs
  desk : desk_kind

table desks
policy unique
| sold_in              | opened | -> desk      |
| Home, Men's, Women's | false  | floor        |
| Children's           | false  | kids_counter |
| -                    | true   | service_desk |
